{"title":"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/0/ff01d054c3726c1b28a276e8f4a01069c709ea3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$444 - 44 - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/6/1763975cc125f72450af4c8204fc16584b6972bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 396 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 402 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 392 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 400 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 408$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"479\" height=\"18\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/8/218baf000d7f51e11d52b02a5614a7720b9e54d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$444 - 44 - 4 = 400 - 4 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 396}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"282\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Overcomplicated.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Overcomplicated)\">Solution 2 (Overcomplicated)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Overcomplicated)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Obviously, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/c/21ca161cbf70663338c6a6842573d382e313c536.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$444-44-4=4(111-11-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"247\" height=\"20\" />, but you don't want to calculate that. By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chinese_Remainder_Theorem\" title=\"Chinese Remainder Theorem\">Chinese Remainder Theorem</a>,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/3/0c3959fd3a865b7c570c8a5eab1ce16563ab6aaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$444 \\equiv 0 \\text{(mod 4)}, 44 \\equiv 0 \\text{(mod 4)},4\\equiv0 \\text {(mod 4)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"348\" height=\"18\" />. Next, apply mod 9 (really any number could work): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/8/728173465a12ad67ce3ead297e8e49832574a269.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$444 \\equiv 3 \\text{(mod 9)}, 44 \\equiv 8 \\text{(mod 9)}, 4 \\equiv4 \\text{(mod 9}) \\rightarrow 444-44-4\\equiv 3-8-4\\equiv -9 \\equiv 0 \\text{(mod 9)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"711\" height=\"20\" />. Thus our answer is divisible by both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> a.k.a. it's divisible by 36. Now you can try dividing all the answer choices by 36 and you find the only answer choice divisible by 36 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/3/4a37052ea19b6ceda3d1f99e89e28077a9cfce01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 396}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"76\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Prob